        "summary": "Flash Events",
        "description": "Machine-readable derived flash-event feed (objective, no investment advice).\n\nPublic endpoint: AI crawlers and the cibohk frontend read this JSON directly\ninstead of parsing HTML. Query: ?locale=zh-CN&limit=50&stock_code=07688",
